   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="edition">
            <ab xml:lang="Egyd-Egydmd egy-demp">
               <pb n="R" />
               <lb n="1" rend="right-to-left" />ḫrw <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p9880">H̱nm-m-ꜣḫ.t</persName> m-bꜣḥ <lb n="2" /><persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#p9885">Ḥr-wḏꜣ</persName>
               <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#idt241" type="title">pꜣ sẖ ı͗r.ṱ.w</rs>
               <lb n="3" />ı͗ ḏı͗ <persName ref="ancient_persons.xml#d45">Pꜣ-Rꜥ</persName> q(y) <supplied evidence="parallel" reason="omitted">pꜣy=f</supplied> ꜥḥꜥ <lb n="4" />ı͗n=w n=y pꜣy ⸢bky?⸣ r-dbꜣ <lb n="5" />tꜣ ẖr(.t) pꜣ bı͗k ḏı͗=y <lb n="6" />ḏı͗=w ı͗wf ꜥꜣy <lb n="7" />10 (n-)ḏr.t <rs ref="ancient_titles.xml#idt242" type="title">pꜣ ı͗ry-ꜥꜣ</rs> r.ḏı͗=k <lb n="8" />ı͗y=f r ẖ pꜣy hb=k <lb n="9" />n.ı͗m=f ı͗w=f ḫpr ı͗w <lb n="10" />wn md(.t) dy my <lb n="11" />ḥn=w s mtw=k hb <lb n="12" />n=y n.ı͗m=s n-ḏr.t <lb n="13" />n <date notAfter="-246" notBefore="-332" when-custom="Ptolemaic dynasty (early)">ḥsb.t 3 ı͗bd 1 ꜣḫ.t sw 24</date>
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang=" en">
               <pb n="" />
               <lb n="1" />Voice of Chnoummachis before <lb n="2" />Haryotes, the scribe-of-eyes: <lb n="3" />Oh may Pre cause <supplied cert="high" evidence="parallel" reason="omitted">his</supplied> lifetime to be long! <lb n="4" />It was brought to me this letter <note>Cf. Den Brinker / Muhs / Vleeming, DBL (2005), 13.</note> concerning <lb n="5" />the food of the falcon. I have caused <lb n="6" />the meat of 10 <lb n="7" />donkeys to be given to the pastophor, whom you <lb n="8" />caused to come, according to that (matter) which you have <note>For the translation cf. Den Brinker / Muhs / Vleeming, DBL (2005), 49.</note> sent <lb n="9" />about. If it happens that here <note>According to Den Brinker / Muhs / Vleeming, DBL (2005), 49. Zauzich, P. Berl. Eleph. 1 (1978): „dort“.</note>is <lb n="10" />something (which is desired): It may <lb n="11" />be ordered that you send <lb n="12" />to me about it. Written <lb n="13" />in the 3rd regnal year, 24th of Thoth. </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
